"contentData":{"id":"dag742cregj1r1qt6dbg","createdAt":"$D2026-09-08T20:37:29.293Z","updatedAt":"$D2026-09-09T02:42:06.979Z","path":"/models/openai/gpt-image-2.5/flare/text-to-image","slot":"main","content":"## Pricing\nThe following table shows the pricing of ChatGPT Images 2.5 from a technical standpoint.\n| Size | low | medium | high | xhigh | max |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| 1024×768 | $0.00402 | $0.00903 | $0.03612 | $0.06420 | $0.14445 |\n| 1024×1024 | $0.00588 | $0.01317 | $0.05268 | $0.09366 | $0.21072 |\n| 1024×1536 | $0.00474 | $0.01029 | $0.04116 | $0.07377 | $0.16464 |\n| 1920×1080 | $0.00441 | $0.01029 | $0.03960 | $0.07041 | $0.15840 |\n| 2560×1440 | $0.00615 | $0.01434 | $0.05529 | $0.09828 | $0.22110 |\n| 3840×2160 | $0.01113 | $0.02595 | $0.10008 | $0.17790 | $0.40026 |\n\n**This implies the following:** Longer prompts increase the cost, more complex requests (involving use of world knowledge, etc.) cost more, and larger images cost more. ","type":"markdown","props":null}
{"id":"openai/gpt-image-2.5/flare/text-to-image","modelId":"dag68ccregj0c4arse8g","isFavorited":false,"title":"GPT Image 2.5 Flare Text to Image","category":"text-to-image","tags":["realism","typography","stylized"],"shortDescription":"OpenAI's default image model for most applications. Fast, high-quality generation with natural lighting, rich textures, and support for complex layouts including transparent backgrounds.","thumbnailUrl":"https://v3b.fal.media/files/b/0aa9a39a/1RpGwGDfDZbwC_QBhudJo.jpg","modelUrl":"https://fal.run/openai/gpt-image-2.5/flare/text-to-image","githubUrl":"","licenseType":"commercial","date":"2026-09-08T19:38:25.222Z","group":{"key":"gpt-25","label":"Text to Image Flare"},"pricingInfoOverride":"Text tokens (per 1M): **$5.00** input, **$1.25** cached, **$10.00** output.\nImage tokens (per 1M): **$8.00** input, **$2.00** cached, **$30.00** output. Changing the **quality** parameter significantly affects cost; by default we use **high**. Adjust it to your preference.\nSee the description at the bottom of this page for more details on how much canonical image sizes cost. Total cost is rounded up to the closest hundredth of a cent ($0.0001.)","machineType":null,"examples":[],"authSkippable":false,"status":"public","publishedAt":"2026-09-08T20:10:48.775Z","deprecated":false,"resultComparison":false,"hidePricing":false,"removed":false,"modelLab":"OpenAI","modelLabId":"d8m36bkregj5ka3lrdhg","modelFamily":"GPT Image 2.5","landingPageSlug":"gpt-image-2.5","hostingType":"proxy","kind":"inference","trainingEndpoints":[]}